2026-11-06T03:20:05.1454290Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-06T03:20:05.1455000Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-06T03:20:05.1455517Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-06T03:20:05.1456020Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-06T03:20:05.1456991Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-06T03:20:05.1457476Z    /root
2026-11-06T03:20:05.1467342Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T03:20:05.1468106Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T03:20:05.1480268Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-06T03:20:05.1481169Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-06T03:20:05.1481462Z 
2026-11-06T03:20:05.1482670Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-11-06T03:20:05.1483405Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
